        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Weir, Harrison Ford, Kelly McGillis, Pamela Wallace\n- Works: Witness, Wild Search, Straight from the Heart\n- Topics: film adaptation, pseudo-remake\n\nFacts:\n- Witness is a 1985 American crime thriller film directed by Peter Weir and starring Harrison Ford and Kelly McGillis.\n- Pamela Wallace was born in 1949 in Exeter, California, and she is an American screenwriter and author.\n- Wild Search is a pseudo-remake of the 1985 film Witness, and it deals with Hong Kong cops and Mainland criminals.\n- Straight from the Heart is based on a romance novel by Pamela Wallace.",
